          "src": "/assets/img/tei-borriggar-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TD is a series of electric/hydraulic drilling machines for limited-access drilling (cellar rigs), designed to install micropiles and self-drilling anchors. Perfect for operation in small spaces, under buildings or in tunnels. TEI’s drill rigs require only an external power source, which reduces noise and exhaust fumes. In addition, the rubber tracks can be retracted to 1,219 mm to enable extended access and positioning in limited-access situations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The number next to the model name indicates the horsepower of the electric motor. The 75 kW (100 HP) electric motor allows the TD100 to drive all drifters or rotary heads made by TEI."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Navigate on to the rig of interest to see which best suits your purposes. <a href=\"/contacto\">Contact us</a> for more information."
        },
